\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 1. Topic:\

\f1\b0  Solar Thermal Management, Efficiency Optimization, Active Cooling Systems\

\f0\b 2. Problem:\

\f1\b0  Design and implement an active cooling control system that maintains solar panel temperature below 45\'b0C to maximize power output efficiency and prevent performance degradation under varying environmental conditions.\
\

